<title>USA: OMAHA HOGS $0.75 LOWER - USDA.</title>
<headline>OMAHA HOGS $0.75 LOWER - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.75 lower.</p>
<p>Top $55.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs    55.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    260-280 lbs    54.00-54.50</p>
<p>Sows: 20 percent. Weak to 1.00 lower. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    350-500 lbs    45.00-45.50</p>
<p>US 2-3    500-650 lbs mostly 49.00</p>
</text>
